{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"tv/22104","tmdb_id":22104,"title":"棒球英豪","original_title":"タッチ","overview":"上杉达也（三矢雄二 配音）和上杉和也（难波圭一 配音）是一对孪生兄弟，与住在隔壁的浅仓南（日高法子 配音）从小一起长大。三人都进入了明青学园就读。虽为双胞胎，但达也和和也的性格全然相反。和也是学校女生的偶像，棒球队的王牌；而达也则懒散，对什么都满不在乎。学校里，和也和小南是公认的完美的一对。达也也觉得二人的般配，只在心里默默的喜欢着小南。但小南则似乎总是有意无意的接近关心着达也。\n\n和也率领着棒球队打到了进入甲子园的关键一战，在决赛的前晚，和也表达了对小南的爱意，但小南并未回应。第二天早晨，一切亦如往昔，但变化说来就来。在去集合的路上，因救小孩而出车祸的和也抢救无效，长眠在了夺取胜利的路上，也终止了带小南去甲子园的约定。在这个悲伤的夏天，达也决定拾起弟弟未完成的梦想，加入了棒球社。去往甲子园的路漫长而曲折，小南也璀璨如遥远的星，但一步步坚定的前进终将会迎来Touch到他们的一天。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxtmMvfTOYRL4fQn9B8Pla6oH2N.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFt5neYXckywPlzbLszSN1cD6jB.jpg","first_air_date":"1985-03-24","last_air_date":"1987-03-22","year":"1985","episode_run_time":"25 minutes","number_of_episodes":101,"number_of_seasons":1,"tmdb_rating_average":9.04,"tmdb_votes":25,"tmdb_rating":"9.04 / 10 from 25 users","genres":["动画","剧情","喜剧"],"languages":["Japanese"],"countries":["Japan"],"production_companies":["Gallop","TOHO","Group TAC","ADK"],"directors":[],"producers":[],"cast":[{"id":237075,"name":"难波圭一","original_name":"難波圭一","character":"Kazuya Uesugi (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/qazcRBlCE0XJMeXIiSUvPcZNsd8.jpg"},{"id":150131,"name":"三矢雄二","original_name":"三ツ矢雄二","character":"Tatsuya Uesugi (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/6IguUqrirpkZZSwEkbxrlVMRsEV.jpg"},{"id":55662,"name":"日高范子","original_name":"日髙のり子","character":"Minami Asakura (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/43OuwsjqGf7JxpFpUvB75OdDDXQ.jpg"},{"id":985092,"name":"林家正藏","original_name":"林家正蔵","character":"Koutarou Matsudaira (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/gdKeZpyoo7dv7MTx0v7NbfdITHY.jpg"},{"id":122481,"name":"银河万丈","original_name":"銀河万丈","character":"Shouhei Harada (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/qiXnKaZheMiVyA1U2mX9tPdNA3T.jpg"},{"id":